OL,3,GNEWSATeams working to prevent fire at
OL,4,Abeauty spot
OL,5,
OL,6,FRangers working to protect Dartmoor all
OL,7,Fyear round are reminding people that
OL,8,Ffires are not allowed at the national
OL,9,Fpark at any time and can prove
OL,10,Fdisastrous.
OL,12,FDeputy head ranger Ella Briens told BBC
OL,13,FSpotlight: "A wildfire at this time of
OL,14,Fyear would be so impactful and the fire
OL,15,Fitself could actually go underground
OL,16,Fand continue burning for days, weeks,
OL,17,Feven months."
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
