OL,3,GNEWSATeams working to prevent fire at
OL,4,Abeauty spot
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said the team had to move people in
OL,7,Ftents in areas closed to camping and
OL,8,Ffound the remains of barbecues which
OL,9,Fhad scorched the parched grass around
OL,10,Fthem.
OL,12,FDartmoor marshals had patrolled the
OL,13,Fbeauty spot and advised people about
OL,14,Ffire risks. Firebreaks have also been
OL,15,Ferected to help stop fires spreading.
